#: .\__translations\__translations.py:6
msgctxt "female"
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to delete your Speedy Net account? This is permanent "
"and irreversible. Deleting your Speedy Net account will also delete your "
"Speedy Match account. If you are sure, type \"Yes. Delete my account.\" in "
"this field, exactly and case sensitive."
msgstr ""
"Ziur zaude zure Speedy Net kontua ezabatu nahi duzula? Hau iraunkorra eta "
"atzeraezina da. Zure Speedy Net kontua ezabatzeak zure Speedy Match kontua "
"ere ezabatuko du. Ziur bazaude, idatzi \"Bai. Ezabatu nire kontua.\" eremu "
"honetan, zehazki eta maiuskulak/minuskulak errespetatuz."

